Package: multistateLifespanInequality
Type: Package
Title: Replication Code for "Threshold Age for Multistate Life Table Entropy: A Perturbation Approach"
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Phanidhar", "Upadhyaya", email = "phanidhar.u@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jos\u00e9 Manuel", "Aburto", role = "aut"),
    person("Kaushalendra", "Kumar", role = "aut"),
    person("Abhishek", "Singh", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Reproducible code for continuous-age multistate life tables,
    age-varying Gompertz transition intensities, threshold age conditions for
    lifespan inequality (entropy, life disparity, variance, coefficient of variation,
    and Drewnowski's index), and sensitivity analyses.
